{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00026","headline":"冬狩 · 太宗皇帝","name":"冬狩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烈烈寒风起，惨惨飞云浮。\n霜浓凝广隰，冰厚结清流。\n金鞍移上苑，玉勒骋平畴。\n旌旗四望合，罝罗一面求。\n楚踣争兕殪，秦亡角鹿愁。\n兽忙投密树，鸿惊起砾洲。\n骑敛原尘静，戈回岭日收。\n心非洛汭逸，意在渭滨游。\n禽荒非所乐，抚辔更招忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00026.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00026","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}